WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:17.642
Skyler: Theo, why don't you practice painting Frankie?

2
00:00:17.643 --> 00:00:20.981
Chatter: Hurry up! You'll be late for school.

3
00:00:20.982 --> 00:00:24.128
Theo: I don't really want to go to school, Chatter.

4
00:00:24.129 --> 00:00:28.344
I'm not a good painter.

5
00:00:28.345 --> 00:00:32.106
Riley: Here's some paper, a brush, and paints.

6
00:00:32.107 --> 00:00:34.680
Ben: I'll hold Frankie while you practice.

7
00:00:34.681 --> 00:00:39.013
Frankie: Ribbit. Ribbit.

8
00:00:39.014 --> 00:00:49.487
Theo: Okay.

9
00:00:49.488 --> 00:00:54.795
I'm done.

10
00:00:54.796 --> 00:00:58.743
Ben: That's Frankie?

11
00:00:58.744 --> 00:01:01.252
Skyler: It kind of looks like a fish.

12
00:01:01.253 --> 00:01:03.852
Sarah: Or a cloud.

13
00:01:03.853 --> 00:01:05.507
Theo: I told you.

14
00:01:05.508 --> 00:01:07.433
I can't paint!

15
00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:09.770
Theo: What am I going to do?

16
00:01:09.771 --> 00:01:11.971
Riley: Just do your best.

17
00:01:11.972 --> 00:01:15.420
That's what my mom always says.

18
00:01:15.421 --> 00:01:22.964
Frankie: Ribbit. Ribbit.

19
00:01:22.965 --> 00:01:26.942
Miss Keen: Okay, it's time to paint your pet.

20
00:01:26.943 --> 00:01:29.891
Please work quietly.

21
00:01:29.892 --> 00:01:34.959
Chatter: Shh. Quiet time!

22
00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:40.769
Skyler: Remember, Theo, just do your best!

23
00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:44.128
Miss Keen: Mr. Peabody will be here later.

24
00:01:44.129 --> 00:01:48.612
He will judge your paintings.

25
00:01:48.613 --> 00:01:57.586
Alexia: I hope Spooky gets to be a TV star.

26
00:01:57.587 --> 00:02:01.319
Skyler: Theo, let me see your painting.

27
00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:03.930
Theo: Promise you won't laugh?

28
00:02:03.931 --> 00:02:06.190
Skyler: I promise.

29
00:02:06.191 --> 00:02:12.711
Theo: Here it is.

30
00:02:12.712 --> 00:02:18.826
Skyler: It's good . . . I mean it's a good painting of something.

31
00:02:18.827 --> 00:02:22.969
Skyler: I just don't know what.

32
00:02:22.970 --> 00:02:29.816
Jason: It looks like a squished worm.

33
00:02:29.817 --> 00:02:32.361
Theo: I'll never be able to paint.

34
00:02:32.362 --> 00:02:38.925
And Frankie will never be a TV star!

35
00:02:38.926 --> 00:02:41.748
Miss Keen: Class, get ready.

36
00:02:41.749 --> 00:02:45.096
Mr. Peabody will be here soon.

37
00:02:45.097 --> 00:02:50.276
Miss Keen: He'll choose the winner!
